    "hypotheses": [
      {
        "description": "Probable cause for the observed missing request/response bodies is a payload-capture-disabled state on the canonical tool-executor record for Cedar, not a downstream dashboard-only copy gap. The affected executor log already shows audit_row_present=true, payload_storage_enabled=false, and null request/response payloads; public reference material matches that row shape when payload storage is disabled. This explains the missing payload visibility for the observed Cedar execution, but the supplied evidence does not identify who or what set that state.",
        "supporting_evidence": [
          "ev_df6be1bfe035",
          "ev_e62367042a00",
          "ev_fa27345b6b60"
        ],
        "contradicting_evidence": [
          "ev_97d681b5ec6e"
        ],
        "confidence": "medium",
        "assumptions": [
          "The public payload-storage behavior described in the knowledge record applies to this production environment.",
          "Cedar's failures, backlog, and latency may be related to execution distress, but they do not by themselves explain why the canonical row shows payload_storage_enabled=false.",
          "No supplied canonical record attributes the disabled payload-storage state to a specific actor or change event."
        ]
      },
      {
        "description": "A provider-side failure may have contributed to Cedar's 500s, but it is not the best explanation for the missing payload fields. The same-time Maple record shows the provider was available and an unrelated read succeeded, which argues against a broad provider outage. This remains an alternative explanation for some Cedar execution failures, not for the payload omission mechanism itself.",
        "supporting_evidence": [
          "ev_97d681b5ec6e"
        ],
        "contradicting_evidence": [
          "ev_6bba7f4ff426",
          "ev_df6be1bfe035",
          "ev_b1f4405b6802"
        ],
        "confidence": "low",
        "assumptions": [
          "This alternative addresses Cedar's execution failures more than the missing-payload symptom.",
          "No same-request upstream trace was supplied, so provider reachability for req-redacted-demo is unverified."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "recommended_actions": [
      "Collect canonical config/decision telemetry for request_id=req-redacted-demo to determine why payload_storage_enabled was false; recommended action only, not executed.",
      "Align executor, audit, and persistence telemetry by request ID before/during/after the incident window to distinguish disabled capture from delayed persistence; recommended action only, not executed.",
      "Request a nearby healthy canonical execution that explicitly shows request/response payload capture, because the current Maple control only helps scope provider health; recommended action only, not executed.",
      "Monitor Cedar-specific upstream error details separately from the payload-visibility issue, since underlying_error_code is null on the observed executor row; recommended action only, not executed.",
      "Treat synthetic telemetry cautiously: partial reproduce/metrics results are incomplete and should not be used to prove absence of wider impact; recommended action only, not executed."
    ],
